{
  "_readme": [
    "Magician's LLM pricing table. Per-model prices live HERE, not in code: change a price by adding a row, no rebuild.",
    "This repo copy is the seed: it is compiled into the binary as the base table, and a deployment's",
    "<MAGICIAN_ROOT_DIR>/llm_pricing.json, if present, layers on top for machine-local overrides only (never copy this whole file there).",
    "Code keeps only basic defaults under the file: a catch-all row per provider, the free local engines, and web-search fees.",
    "Resolution for a call at time T: only rows with effective_from <= T compete; the longest matching model_prefix wins,",
    "then the latest effective_from (on a full tie, the deployment file beats the seed). To change a price going forward,",
    "ADD a row with a later effective_from: never edit an old row (stored cost_usd and each row's pricing fingerprint are",
    "frozen at write; use `magician analytics reprice-llm-calls` to correct historical rows).",
    "1970-01-01 rows are the launch/base rates. Some carry exact float values (0.30000000000000004 for 10% of 3.0) so their",
    "fingerprints match what past calls recorded; do not round them.",
    "rates: text models, USD per million tokens. Absent cache_read_per_m / cache_write_per_m = no such bucket; those tokens",
    "bill at input_per_m. prompt_tokens includes cached tokens; cached buckets are subtracted before uncached input is billed.",
    "Optional long_context multiplies input (uncached and cached) and output when prompt_tokens > threshold_tokens.",
    "An empty model_prefix is a per-provider catch-all. Unknown provider strings are kept as custom providers and only",
    "match calls attributed to that exact provider string (decision:<adapter> rows price Decision Models).",
    "realtime_rates: realtime voice models by model_prefix, USD per million text and audio tokens, plus per_second for",
    "models billed by the clock (0 otherwise).",
    "grok-voice bills $0.08 per audio minute (xAI model page; its $0.004 per text input is not modelled), as per_second.",
    "web_search_rates: provider-executed web search, USD per call, latest effective row per provider.",
    "media_rates: text-to-speech (kind tts) and speech-to-text (stt for uploads, stt_streaming for streams), by provider and",
    "model_prefix, in usd_per_million_chars, usd_per_audio_minute and/or usd_per_request. Token-billed voice models are",
    "converted at the vendor's published audio rate (Gemini: 25 audio tokens per second) and ~4 characters per text token.",
    "INR prices are converted at 88 INR/USD.",
    "effective_from is YYYY-MM-DD, interpreted as UTC midnight."
  ],
